>
  <section class="section wrap service-page__intro">
    <p class="type-label service-page__eyebrow">Services</p>
    <h1 class="type-display service-page__heading">Custom Drapery</h1>
    <p class="service-page__lead">
      Custom drapery in Cincinnati and Northern Kentucky, worked out in the room it belongs to.
      Amy picks the fabric, settles the details, sews the treatment, and hangs it herself. The
      custom curtains that show up on installation day are the ones the room was measured for.
